; An example zone served by dohyo. The names (RFC 2606) and addresses (RFC 5737, RFC 3849) are for documentation.
;
; Only SOA, NS, A, AAAA and HTTPS are accepted. $ORIGIN is required and $TTL takes seconds only.
; Raise the serial on every change: a reload with the same serial but different content is refused.

$ORIGIN sub.example.com.
$TTL 3600

@  IN SOA   ns.example.com. hostmaster.example.com. (
            2026092501 ; serial (YYYYMMDDnn)
            7200       ; refresh
            3600       ; retry
            1209600    ; expire
            300 )      ; minimum (negative responses are cached for min(SOA TTL, this))

; The same name set as the delegation in the parent zone (example.com).
@  IN NS    ns.example.com.

@  IN A     192.0.2.10
@  IN AAAA  2001:db8::10

; List only the protocols the web server actually speaks.
@  IN HTTPS 1 . alpn=h3,h2
